# Never bundle secrets or dev-only artifacts into a Vercel deployment.
# (GitHub-integration deployments clone fresh from git, where these are
# already absent — this guards local `vercel build`/`vercel deploy` runs,
# which read the real local working tree instead.)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
backend/tests
memory
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/build
.git
